{"id":"r4-d89d7d","status":"read","groups":[{"levels":[[{"surface":"أحمد بن حنبل","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"يحيى بن سعيد","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"سفيان","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"حبيب","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"سعيد","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"ابن عباس","kind":"narrator"}]],"saying":1,"saying_opens":"حرم من النسب سبع، ومن الصهر سبع"},{"levels":[[{"surface":"ابن سيرين","kind":"narrator"}]],"saying":2,"saying_opens":"لا بأس به"},{"levels":[[{"surface":"الحسن","kind":"narrator"}]],"saying":3,"saying_opens":"وكرهه الحسن مرة ثم قال"},{"levels":[[{"surface":"جابر بن زيد","kind":"narrator","occurrence":1}]],"saying":4,"saying_opens":"وكرهه جابر بن زيد للقطيعة"},{"levels":[[{"surface":"عكرمة","kind":"narrator","occurrence":1}],[{"surface":"ابن عباس","kind":"narrator","occurrence":2}]],"saying":5,"saying_opens":"إذا زنى بأخت امرأته لم تحرم"},{"levels":[[{"surface":"يحيى الكندي","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"الشعبي","kind":"narrator"},{"surface":"أبو جعفر","kind":"narrator"}]],"saying":6,"saying_opens":"فيمن يلعب بالصبي إن أدخله فيه"},{"levels":[[{"surface":"عكرمة","kind":"narrator","occurrence":2}],[{"surface":"ابن عباس","kind":"narrator","occurrence":3}]],"saying":7,"saying_opens":"إذا زنى بها لم تحرم عليه امرأته"},{"levels":[[{"surface":"أبو نصر","kind":"narrator"}]],"saying":8,"saying_opens":"أن ابن عباس حرمه"},{"levels":[[{"surface":"عمران بن حصين","kind":"narrator"},{"surface":"جابر بن زيد","kind":"narrator","occurrence":2},{"surface":"الحسن","kind":"narrator","occurrence":2},{"surface":"بعض أهل العراق","kind":"unnamed"}]],"saying":9,"saying_opens":"وبعض أهل العراق تحرم عليه"},{"levels":[[{"surface":"أبو هريرة","kind":"narrator"}]],"saying":10,"saying_opens":"لا تحرم حتى يلزق بالأرض"},{"levels":[[{"surface":"ابن المسيب","kind":"narrator"},{"surface":"عروة","kind":"narrator"},{"surface":"الزهري","kind":"narrator","occurrence":1}]],"saying":11,"saying_opens":"وجوزه ابن المسيب وعروة والزهري"},{"levels":[[{"surface":"الزهري","kind":"narrator","occurrence":2}],[{"surface":"علي","kind":"narrator","occurrence":3}]],"saying":12,"saying_opens":"قال علي لا تحرم"}],"shared_tail":null,"needs_ruling":false,"notes":["Bukhari 5161 is a long series of separate sayings on marriage. Saying 1 is the only full chain (Ibn Abbas). Each later «وقال X» opens its own transmission, so each is its own saying (rule 4a) with a single link or a short chain.","Acts with no transmitter («جمع عبد الله بن جعفر بين ابنة علي») are not groups. Bukhari's own remarks («وليس فيه تحريم», «ويحيى هذا غير معروف», «وهذا مرسل») are not chains.","Single-link sayings are read from rule 10. The groups are listed as the text writes them; the separate sayings are not merged, even where they name the same man (Ikrima in sayings 5 and 7, Ali in saying 12 with different surfaces)."],"fixes":[]}
